    "benefits": "Current matched0/1/8 median body times improve19.809/12.071/9.270 percent; process RSS medians equal or lower. Flat N known entries reduce record allocator calls fromN to1 miss with eventual domain teardown; a source law, not measured total malloc count. Positive scoped latency, no universal speedup.",
