    "process": "One complete storage responsibility, six selected source/test paths; unrelated31 pending paths preserved. Thirteen-stage lifecycle/entry follow-through; independent SMP remains1/12 with11open, no patch-line credit.",
    "checklist": "dev/refactoring/modern-c/activation-storage.org#activation-storage",
    "models": "Actual OpenSysML SDK7 obligations/3 source refinements and shared ASCENT missing/stale controls. Existing native_entry_admission QNT owns logical lifetime/known settlement; RootSpan Lean arithmetic unchanged.47 exact selected policy tests and actual policy counterfactual4 false-admissions\u21920; no duplicate model.",
    "open": "Original negative routing cohort and hardware-cause gap remain. No whole CFFI, generational GC, arbitrary private-API stale-pointer recovery, unknown physical death, full debug/remote CI or SMP promotion. Two old invalid context.heap_limit generator proposals remain separate disposition, not runtime benefit."
